#: echorepo/templates/results.html:578
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is the third and final survey in the project, following the initial "
"ones you completed before and after\n"
"\n"
"      soil sampling. The majority of questions are consistent with the "
"previous surveys so that we can accurately\n"
"\n"
"      measure changes over time and understand the impact of project "
"participation."
msgstr ""
"Dëst ass déi drëtt a lescht Ëmfro am Projet, no deenen éischten Ëmfroen, "
"déi Dir virun an no der\n"
"      Buedemprouwenahm ausgefëllt hutt. Déi meescht Froe sinn d’selwecht "
"wéi an de viregten Ëmfroen, sou datt mir präzis\n"
"      Verännerungen iwwer d’Zäit moossen an den Impakt vun der "
"Participatioun um Projet verstoen kënnen."

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:588
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Before you start: please only complete this survey if the lab results "
"from your soil sample(s) have already\n"
"\n"
"      been added to the repository. If the results are pending, please "
"check back at a later time."
msgstr ""
"Ier Dir ufänkt: fëllt dës Ëmfro w.e.g. nëmmen aus, wann d’Laborresultater"
" vun Ärer Buedemprouf oder Äre Buedemprouwen schonn\n"
"      an de Repository bäigesat goufen. Wann d’Resultater nach ausstinn, "
"kommt w.e.g. méi spéit nach eng Kéier zeréck."

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:600
msgid "Go to final survey"
msgstr "Bei d’Ofschlossëmfro goen"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:609
msgid "Data use information"
msgstr "Informatioun iwwer d’Benotzung vun den Donnéeën"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:619
