msgstr "Ech hunn se schonn ausgefëllt"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:629
msgid "Processing survey data in the ECHO project"
msgstr "Veraarbechtung vun Ëmfrodonnéeën am ECHO-Projet"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:633
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The objective of this survey data is to examine the impact of project "
"participation on participant\n"
"\n"
"        attitudes and motivation towards soil."
msgstr ""
"D’Zil vun dësen Ëmfrodonnéeën ass et, den Afloss vun der Participatioun "
"um Projet op d’Astellungen an d’Motivatioun\n"
"        vun de Participante vis-à-vis vum Buedem z’ënnersichen."

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:641
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your information will only be used for scientific purposes. We do not "
"collect names or addresses. Your\n"
"\n"
"        details regarding age and gender are only used for statistical "
"purposes and all details are collected and\n"
"\n"
"        evaluated anonymously. It is not possible to draw conclusions "
"about your person at any time."
msgstr ""
"Är Informatioune ginn nëmme fir wëssenschaftlech Zwecker benotzt. Mir "
"sammelen weder Nimm nach Adressen. Är\n"
"        Informatiounen iwwer Alter a Geschlecht ginn nëmme fir "
